--- !u!114 &334027179
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 334027177}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 414aea866f59e7e4899c99da58deec34, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 612573763}
  activityDialogues:
  - dialogueText: "\u0130zcili\u011Fin en \xF6nemli kurallar\u0131ndan biri ekipmanlar\u0131m\u0131za
      sahip \xE7\u0131kmakt\u0131r. Bu y\xFCzden her kamp ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131nda
      e\u015Fyalar\u0131nla ilgili baz\u0131 bilgileri not defterine kaydetmelisin.
      Haydi ba\u015Flayal\u0131m Yavrukurt!"
  - dialogueText: "[name], birazdan a\u011Fa\xE7ta as\u0131l\u0131 olan dinamometreye
      \xE7antan\u0131 takarak \xE7antan\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      not defterine kaydedece\u011Fiz.."
  - dialogueText: "Ayr\u0131ca sonra eski notlar\u0131na da g\xF6z atabilirsin. B\xF6ylece
      t\xFCm notlar\u0131na istedi\u011Fin zaman ula\u015Fabilirsin.."
  - dialogueText: "Dinamometreyi kullanmak i\xE7in \xE7antay\u0131 tutup dinamometreye
      s\xFCr\xFCklemelisin. Dinamometre Newton biriminde \xE7antan\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      \xF6l\xE7ecek!"
  - dialogueText: "Harika, dinamometre 80N de\u011Ferini g\xF6steriyor. \u015Eimdi
      bu de\u011Feri not defterine kaydetmelisin. Not defterine sa\u011F \xFCstteki
      butona t\u0131klayarak ula\u015Fabilirsin."
  - dialogueText: "S\xFCper, h\u0131zl\u0131 kavr\u0131yorsun! Bu kavramlardan baz\u0131lar\u0131
      sana bir yerden tan\u0131d\u0131k gelmi\u015F olmal\u0131.."
  - dialogueText: "A\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k: bir cismin yer \xE7ekimi nedeniyle \xFCzerine
      etki eden kuvvet olarak tan\u0131mlan\u0131r."
  - dialogueText: "S\u0131rada \xE7antan\u0131n taban alan\u0131n\u0131 belirlemek
      var. \xC7ad\u0131rlar\u0131m\u0131z b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFCne g\xF6re ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131
      i\xE7in \xE7antan\u0131n yere temas eden y\xFCzey alan\u0131n\u0131 hesaplamal\u0131s\u0131n.
      Bakal\u0131m \xF6l\xE7\xFCmlerde ne kadar iyisin!"
  - dialogueText: "Cetvelle uzun ve k\u0131sa kenar\u0131 \xF6l\xE7\xFCp de\u011Ferleri
      sa\u011Fdaki \xD6l\xE7er\u2019e yazmal\u0131s\u0131n [name]! B\xF6ylece \xD6l\xE7er
      senin i\xE7in taban alan\u0131n\u0131 hesaplayacak \u0130lk olarak k\u0131sa
      kenardan ba\u015Flamal\u0131s\u0131n!"
  - dialogueText: "K\u0131sa kenar de\u011Ferini girdin, s\u0131rada uzun kenar var."
  - dialogueText: "Harikas\u0131n, \xD6l\xE7er yard\u0131m\u0131yla \xE7antan\u0131n
      taban alan\u0131n\u0131 do\u011Fru hesaplad\u0131n! B\xF6ylece y\xFCzey alan\u0131
      kavram\u0131n\u0131 da hat\u0131rlam\u0131\u015F olmal\u0131s\u0131n.Elde etti\u011Fin
      verileri not defterine yazmay\u0131 unutma!"
  - dialogueText: "Aferin, ilk aktiviteyi ba\u015Far\u0131yla tamamlad\u0131n Yavrukurt!
      A\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k, kuvvet ve y\xFCzey alan\u0131 kavramlar\u0131n\u0131
      iyi hat\u0131rl\u0131yorsun! Art\u0131k kamp alan\u0131na ekipmanlar\u0131n\u0131
      kurabilirsin. Gel, sana yard\u0131mc\u0131 olay\u0131m ve maceran ba\u015Flas\u0131n!"
  firstActivityCanvas: {fileID: 1568621998}
