--- !u!114 &1258777300
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1258777298}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 282cfeeeda20bf14586c81c383f33c74, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 836198923}
  activityDialogues:
  - dialogueText: "UH! Buradan itibaren ilerlememiz baya zorla\u015Facak gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor.
      Orman\u0131n bu k\u0131sm\u0131na olduk\xE7a fazla kar ya\u011Fm\u0131\u015F
      ve buradan batmadan ge\xE7memiz gerekiyor."
  - dialogueText: "Buradaki tahtalar\u0131 ayaklar\u0131m\u0131za ba\u011Flayarak
      kara batmadan y\xFCr\xFCmek i\u015Fe yarayabilir! Tahtalar\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131
      ayn\u0131 fakat y\xFCzey alanlar\u0131 birbirinden farkl\u0131 gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor.."
  - dialogueText: "\u0130lk olarak y\xFCzey alan\u0131 en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk olan tahtay\u0131
      denemekle ba\u015Flayal\u0131m! Ben tahtan\u0131n \xFCst\xFCne \xE7\u0131karken
      sen de olu\u015Fan durumlar\u0131 not defterine kaydetmelisin. Y\xFCzey alan\u0131
      en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk tahtaya t\u0131kla."
  - dialogueText: "Oh, tahtayla birlikte kara g\xF6m\xFCld\xFCm resmen! G\xF6zlemlerini
      not defterine kaydetmelisin."
  - dialogueText: "S\xFCper. Bu g\xF6zlemlerin maceram\u0131za devam etmemiz i\xE7in
      \xE7ok \xF6nemli. Y\xFCzey alan\u0131 orta b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFCkte olan tahtaya
      t\u0131kla ve onu deneyelim."
  - dialogueText: "\u0130kinci tahtan\u0131n kara ne kadar g\xF6m\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
      not almal\u0131s\u0131n."
  - dialogueText: "G\xFCzel, ikinci tahtay\u0131 da ba\u015Far\u0131yla g\xF6zlemlemi\u015Fsin
      gibi duruyor. Hadi, son tahtaya ge\xE7elim. Son tahtan\u0131n \xFCst\xFCne
      t\u0131klamal\u0131s\u0131n."
  - dialogueText: "Son tahtaya dair g\xF6zlemlerini de not al ve en uygun tahtay\u0131
      se\xE7elim!"
  - dialogueText: "Bravo! Y\xFCzey alanlar\u0131 farkl\u0131 olan tahtalardan karda
      y\xFCr\xFCmeye en uygun olan\u0131 \xFCst\xFCne t\u0131klayarak se\xE7melisin."
  - dialogueText: "\u0130\u015Fte bu! Bu tahtay\u0131 derin kar olan b\xF6lgelerde
      kullanarak kara batmadan ilerleyebiliriz. Peki ya \xE7antayla tahtaya \xE7\u0131karsam?
      Hadi bunu da deneyelim! \xC7antay\u0131 elime uzat\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n? "
  - dialogueText: "De\u011Fi\u015Fimleri g\xF6zlemleyip not defterine kaydetmelisin! "
  - dialogueText: "S\xFCper! \xC7antayla birlikte y\xFCzeye etki eden dik kuvvetin
      artmas\u0131yla bas\u0131n\xE7 da artt\u0131 ve tahta daha \xE7ok kara g\xF6m\xFCld\xFC. "
  - dialogueText: "Bunu bilmemiz yola g\xFCvenle devam etmemiz i\xE7in \xE7ok \xF6nemliydi.
      Hadi, yolumuza devam edelim."
  thirdActivityCanvas: {fileID: 636292381}
  secondActivityCanvas: {fileID: 1087550039}
  fourthActivityCanvas: {fileID: 300109064}
