--- !u!114 &1848819041
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1848819039}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6d206db3b8db2a54286d357dec538212, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 967217249}
  activityDialogues:
  - "Bu y\xFCzden \xE7antam\u0131zdaki balonlar\u0131 \u015Fi\u015Firip omzumuza
    ba\u011Flamal\u0131y\u0131z. B\xF6ylece birbirimizi kaybetmeden yolumuza devam
    edebiliriz!"
  - "Maceran\u0131n en ba\u015F\u0131ndan beri yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z gibi
    balonun boy \xF6l\xE7\xFCs\xFCn\xFC not defterine kaydetmelisin ki maceram\u0131z
    esnas\u0131nda g\xF6zlemler yapabilelim!"
  - "Metreyi kullanarak balonun boy bilgisini not defterine kaydetmelisin. Bu balonun
    b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFC bize ipucu olabilir!"
  - "G\xFCzel, \u015Fimdi balonu omzumuza ba\u011Flad\u0131k ve yola \xE7\u0131kmaya
    haz\u0131r\u0131z. Hedef zirve!"
  - "Yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131 g\xF6zlemler sayesinde
    da\u011F\u0131n zirvesine \xE7\u0131kmay\u0131 ba\u015Fard\u0131k ve..."
  - "Sadece buraya ula\u015Fmay\u0131 ba\u015Faran izcilerin sahip olabilece\u011Fi
    \u201CZirve\u2019de\u201D rozetini kazand\u0131n! Sa\u011Fdaki \"Rozet\" butonuna
    t\u0131klayarak rozetlerine bakabilirsin!"
  - "\u0130lgin\xE7! Balonun b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFC de\u011Fi\u015Fmi\u015F gibi
    g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. Bu durum a\xE7\u0131k hava bas\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131n de\u011Fi\u015Fimiyle
    alakal\u0131 olmal\u0131. Hadi, balonun b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC \xF6l\xE7
    ve not defterine kaydet. B\xF6ylece notlar\u0131na g\xF6re \xE7\u0131kar\u0131mlarda
    bulunabiliriz!"
  - "\u015Eimdi bu de\u011Feri not defterine kaydetmelisin."
  - "S\xFCper! Ger\xE7ekten de balonun b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFC yukar\u0131ya \xE7\u0131kt\u0131k\xE7a
    de\u011Fi\u015Fmi\u015F! Balonun i\xE7ine hava girmedi\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrsek
    balonun d\u0131\u015F y\xFCzeyine etki eden a\xE7\u0131k hava bas\u0131nc\u0131
    de\u011Fi\u015Fmi\u015F olmal\u0131! Hadi, bu durumlar\u0131 not defterine kaydedelim.
    G\xF6zlem ve notlar\u0131ndan yola \xE7\u0131karak a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki bo\u015Fluklar\u0131
    doldurmal\u0131s\u0131n. "
  - "Harika, yolda ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z bir\xE7ok deneyimle alakal\u0131
    \xE7ok yararl\u0131 g\xF6zlemler yapt\u0131n! Kamp alan\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n
    \xE7evresini ke\u015Ffetti\u011Fimize g\xF6re kamp alan\u0131na d\xF6nebiliriz! "
  - "Kamp alan\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n \xE7evresini ke\u015Ffetti\u011Fimize g\xF6re
    kamp alan\u0131na d\xF6nebiliriz! Fakat yola \xE7\u0131kmadan \xF6nce sana g\xFCzel
    bir haberim var... "
  - "Tebrikler, Yavrukurt II r\xFCtbesine y\xFCkseldin!"
  - "D\xF6n\xFC\u015F yoluna koyulal\u0131m!"
